le from the spine.\", \"line\": 5, \"span\": \"When a requested item arrives, print a hold slip and fold it into the item so the name is visible from the spine\"}, {\"text\": \"The item is shelved alphabetically by the borrower's surname.\", \"line\": 5, \"span\": \"shelve it alphabetically by the borrower's surname\"}, {\"text\": \"Borrowers must bring their library card when they come to collect the item.\", \"line\": 5, \"span\": \"Bring your library card when you come to collect it\"}, {\"text\": \"An item waits on the hold shelf for 7 days.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"An item waits on the hold shelf for 7 days\"}, {\"text\": \"Day one is the day the library emails the borrower to let them know the item is ready to collect.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"Day one is the day we email the borrower to let them know it is ready to collect, not the day the item arrived\"}, {\"text\": \"Day one is not the day the item arrived.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"not the day the item arrived\"}, {\"text\": \"The shelf is swept every morning before opening.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"Sweep the shelf every morning before opening\"}, {\"text\": \"Items past 7 days go back into circulation.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"Items past 7 days go back into circulation, or on to the next borrower in the queue if there is one\"}, {\"text\": \"Items past 7 days go on to the next borrower in the queue if there is one.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"Items past 7 days go back into circulation, or on to the next borrower in the queue if there is one\"}, {\"text\": \"A borrower who asks before the 7 days are up can have the item held for a further 7 days.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"A borrower who asks before the 7 days are up can have the item held for a further 7 days\"}, {\"text\": \"The extension of the hold for a further 7 days is granted once per request.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"This is granted once per request\"}, {\"text\": \"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back to the shelves.\", \"line\": 21, \"span\": \"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back to the shelves and the request is cancelled\"}, {\"text\": \"The request is cancelled when an item has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected.\", \"line\": 21, \"span\": \"the request is cancelled\"}, {\"text\": \"The borrower will need to reserve the item again after it has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected.\", \"line\": 21, \"span\": \"the borrower will need to reserve it again\"}]}","ttft_ms":7520,"type":"result","duration_ms":7557,"uuid":"c7d736d7-9a05-44ea-ac9f-19afec3e49d7","ttft_stream_ms":1474,"time_to_request_ms":108,"first_content_frame_ms":1474,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
